l"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-038","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-038-langye-near-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p002","quote":"後立琅邪王覲子長樂亭侯渾為東安王","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p002:m0011","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-038-langye-near-family:p002:m0005"}],"interpretation_note":"子睿承本段覲為傳主；另一處明言覲子渾。父子依此明文，不以嗣位或奉祀反推。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jinshu064-pou-ritual-successor-hun","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAB","predicate":"ritual_successor_of","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAB","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"繼叔父長樂亭侯渾","succession_kind":"ji_named_relative","legal_adoption_status":"not_stated","parentage_inference":"not_inferred"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons:pou-care-succession:p001","quote":"琅邪孝王裒，字道成，母荀氏，以微賤入宮，元帝命虞妃養之。裒初繼叔父長樂亭侯渾，後徙封宣城郡公，拜後將軍。及帝為晉王，有司奏立太子，帝以裒有成人之量，過於明帝，從容謂王導曰：「立子以德不以年。」導曰：「世子、宣城俱有朗雋之目，固當以年。」於是太子位遂定。更封裒琅邪，嗣恭王后，改食會稽、宣城邑五萬二千戶，拜散騎常侍、使持節、都督青徐兗三州諸軍事、車騎將軍，徵還京師。建武元年薨，年十八，贈車騎大將軍，加侍中。及妃山氏薨，祔葬，穆帝更贈裒太保。子哀王安國立，未逾年薨。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons:pou-care-succession:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons:pou-care-succession:p001:m0033"}],"interpretation_note":"原繼、嗣宗祀記錄與生父元帝分開；不單由此建生父或法定收養父親。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jinshu064-pou-paternal-uncle-hun","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAB","predicate":"paternal_uncle","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAB","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"叔父長樂亭侯渾","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons","