033"}],"interpretation_note":"叔父原稱與卷38覲子渾、元帝睿為覲子相合；叔父不是本段生父，完整父系組裝待卷38正式錄入。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jinshu064-pou-hun-identity","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAB","surfaces":["長樂亭侯渾"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons:pou-care-succession:p001:m0033"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-yuandi-six-sons:pou-care-succession:p001","quote":"琅邪孝王裒，字道成，母荀氏，以微賤入宮，元帝命虞妃養之。裒初繼叔父長樂亭侯渾，後徙封宣城郡公，拜後將軍。及帝為晉王，有司奏立太子，帝以裒有成人之量，過於明帝，從容謂王導曰：「立子以德不以年。」導曰：「世子、宣城俱有朗雋之目，固當以年。」於是太子位遂定。更封裒琅邪，嗣恭王后，改食會稽、宣城邑五萬二千戶，拜散騎常侍、使持節、都督青徐兗三州諸軍事、車騎將軍，徵還京師。建武元年薨，年十八，贈車騎大將軍，加侍中。及妃山氏薨，祔葬，穆帝更贈裒太保。子哀王安國立，未逾年薨。"}],"rationale":"卷38正文長樂亭侯渾為琅邪王覲子，與卷64同名同爵相合；不合王渾，叔父不是裒生父。元帝與渾同父的正式關係及家族ID組裝待卷38逐項錄入。","references":[{"title":"《晉書》卷38宗室世系","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2444513","source_revision":2444513,"source_position":{"first_line":31,"last_line":31},"quote":"覲字思祖，拜冗從僕射。太熙元年薨，時年三十五。子睿立，是為元帝。","raw_context_quote":"覲字思祖，拜冗從僕射。{{YL|太熙元年}}薨，時年三十五。子睿立，是為[[晉書/卷006#元帝|元帝]]。","raw_context_quote_sha256":"92b6b1a02491ca0bae5ba6efbd862434aa4a11adf451ec62b694bc2526214b9f","wikitext_sha256":"0ccab16e0c18edff6af7aa242c765c728b3f3e64ab3487a528513843281c2bb3","scope":"primary_parallel_royal_identity","image_verified":false,"raw_context_contains_modern_apparatus":false,"note":"僅摘錄前段正文，展開維基連結與年號模板外殼，不採其後數位校注。"},{"title":"《晉書》卷38宗室世系","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2444513","source_revision":2444513,"source_position":{"first_line":41,"last_